  message: "Validation on osx repo: only 1 abi_call edge found. Root cause: Solidity functions have qualified names (e.g., 'PermissionManager._grant') while TS calls use unqualified names ('contract.applyMultiTargetPermissions'). The linker matches by exact name, so qualified Solidity names don't match unqualified TS calls. Fix: strip contract prefix from Solidity function names when building the match map."  # 2eec
